Package: wnepali
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: wordlist
Description: Nepali wordlist
 A flat, sorted Nepali wordlist derived from the Hunspell Nepali
 SpellChecking Dictionary compiled by Madan Puraskar Pustakalaya,
 expanded via automated affix unmunching and extended with
 additional proper nouns and vocabulary.
 .
 Compatible with /usr/share/dict/ for use by spell checkers and
 other tools requiring a plain Nepali wordlist.
